<P STYLE="margin: 0pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center">AMENDMENT
TO</P>

<P STYLE="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center">DIRECTOR AGREEMENT</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-indent: 0.5in; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify">AMENDMENT
TO DIRECTOR AGREEMENT dated as of August 6, 2025 (the &ldquo;Effective Date&rdquo;) by and between WhiteFiber, Inc., a Cayman Islands
exempted company, with its principal business at 31 Hudson Yards, Floor 11, Suite 30, New York, New York 10001 (the &ldquo;Company&rdquo;)
and Ms. Ichi Shih, with an address at 20 Nongan St. Apt. 4-23, Zhongshan, District, Taipei, Taiwan (the &ldquo;Director&rdquo;).</P>

<P STYLE="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><U>W I T N E S S E T H :</U></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-indent: 0.5in; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify"><B>WHEREAS</B>,
the Company and the Director entered into a Director Agreement dated as of May 30, 2025 (the &ldquo;Agreement&rdquo;);</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-indent: 0.5in; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-indent: 0.5in; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify"><B>WHEREAS</B>,
the Agreement provided for the Director to receive 40,000 restricted Ordinary shares (the &ldquo;Shares&rdquo;) upon the commencement
of trading of the Company&rsquo;s Ordinary Shares on the Nasdaq Capital Market; and</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-indent: 0.5in; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify"><B>WHEREAS</B>, the value of the Initial
Shares was intended to be $120,000.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-indent: 0.5in; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify"><B>NOW,
THEREFORE</B>, in consideration of the mutual premises and covenants and agreements contained herein and for other good and valuable consideration
by each of the parties, the parties hereby agree as follows:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">1. The first sentence
of Section 4. Remuneration is hereby amended to read as follows:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="margin: 0pt 0.75in; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-indent: 0in; text-align: justify">&ldquo;<U>Remuneration.</U> Director&rsquo;s
compensation as an independent director shall be $_4,000 a year, to be paid quarterly and the issuance of restricted share units (&ldquo;RSUs&rdquo;)
with an aggregate value of $120,000, determined based on the initial public offering price. The RSUs will be granted effective upon the
commencement of trading of the Company&rsquo;s ordinary shares on the Nasdaq Capital Market.&rdquo;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-left: 0.5in; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify">Except as set forth herein, the Agreement
remains in full force and effect.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify"><B></B></P>

